    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94db4972c92a01784934e604",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她静静递来的眼神，令我蓦然一怔。\n……今天，我一直与她并肩前行。\n微微出汗的身体，被风舒适地轻抚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ceed17dc78cdf0ac0edcd6469c84c2ddb341987418330ab79d0c89b46b99dbeb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
